From: thekevinbot <248217931+thekevinbot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Generate every python suite

The suite list predates grammars.md having a python template. Drop it so write_integration_tests generates whatever the test directory holds, as the javascript side does.
---
 packages/gbnf/python/Makefile | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/gbnf/python/Makefile b/packages/gbnf/python/Makefile
index 6210a46..1c38652 100644
--- a/packages/gbnf/python/Makefile
+++ b/packages/gbnf/python/Makefile
@@ -25,8 +25,6 @@ write_integration_tests:
 	@echo "Writing integration tests..."
 	@$(MAKE) -s build_test_writer
 	@node --no-warnings ../../test-writer/dist/test-writer.mjs \
-		validation \
-		iteration/iteration \
 		--testDir ../test \
 		--targetDir ./tests/generated \
 		--language python
